{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_02489","headline":"伤始平李少府正己 · 褚亮","name":"伤始平李少府正己","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"劳息本相循，悲欢理自均。\n谁能免玄夜，惜尔正青春。\n迈德惟家宝，生才谅国珍。\n高文缀翡翠，茂学掩麒麟。\n述作纷无已，言谈妙入神。\n断肠虽累月，分手未盈旬。\n辅嗣俄长往，颜生即短辰。\n声华满昭代，形影委穷尘。\n禅草回中使，生刍引吊宾。\n同游秘府日，方驾直城闉。\n并拜黄图右，分曹清渭滨。\n风期嵇吕好，存殁范张亲。\n虚座怜王述，遗篇恸景纯。\n精灵与毫翰，千祀寿何人。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"褚亮","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_02489.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_02489","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}